<Defs>
	<AlienRace.ThingDef_AlienRace ParentName="ParagonBasePawn">
		<defName>LithurRace</defName>
		<label>Lithur</label>
		<description>The Lithurs are a remarkable race of xenos. They are most often described as arrogant, self-confident and melancholic. The internal organs of Lithurs are designed specifically, which allows them to survive potentially fatal wounds. However, they can only consume processed food.
The body is relatively soft, and wounds heal easily and quickly. Military biologists recommend using blunt weapons or explosives since piercing weapons are ineffective against them.
Representatives of the race have two pairs of eyes of different sizes, which emit a bright yellow light. Those who have encountered liturs describe strange effects similar to hypnosis when looking at their face. Despite their obvious ugliness, they have a strange influence upon contact. The skin is oily and protects the Lithur from fire, but dries quickly if there is a lack of fat in the body, shining with a soft yellowish light.
They gain increased mental activity when they are in a well-lit space. Sunset significantly reduces their psychic potential.</description>
